Z||000001||Wolfhound||02-07-2000||05:24 AM||||Darklord, I majored in art at Auburn University and use computer graphics frequently. Mostly Adobe Photoshop, but also Corel. Sometimes working between the two.<BR> I did the title page on our website. <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/pentagon/6215" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/pentagon/6215</A> <BR>using Adobe.<BR> The letter form is filled with a topograhpic map. Background is a photo taken from an OH6 helicopter. The 25th division patch was produced by putting and actual patch in the scanner. I also use a Sony digital camera.<BR>Coy||||reg||1
